ram\n*Raypulse"},{"heading":"Bonded Titans","level":3,"wikitext":"{{TitanCollection}}\n{{TitanRow | [[Jokoul]]|  | | This icy [[Organization]] Titan is this Suit's go-to Titan for combat. }}\n{{TitanCollectionFooter}}","text":""},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\">\nFile:Organization operative.png\nS1E08 Suit 012 invokes Jokoul.png\nS1E08 Unnamed Suit 012.png\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]\n[[Category:Guardians of Thor]]","text":"File:Organization operative.png\nS1E08 Suit 012 invokes Jokoul.png\nS1E08 Unnamed Suit 012.png"}],"full_text":"Unnamed Suit 012 is a Suit in the Organization who operates from the Temple of Thor in Iceland.\n\n== History ==\nThis Suit infiltrated the Guardians of Thor on behalf of the Organization. He tried to prevent Dante Vale, Montehue, and the Huntik team from getting the hammer, Mjolnir. However, he failed even after multiple tries. [Two Powers Become One]\n\n==Personality==\nThis Suit was confident and unpleasant. When he thinks the odds are in his favor, his ego gets really big.\n\n== Abilities ==\nThis Suit relied on his huge army of Guardians of Thor to fight for him as well as his primary Titan, Jokoul. \n\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n\n*Touchram\n*Raypulse\n\n=== Bonded Titans ===\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nFile:Organization operative.png\nS1E08 Suit 012 invokes Jokoul.png\nS1E08 Unnamed Suit 012.png","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox character\n| image     = File:S1E08 Unnamed Suit 012.png\n| aliases   = \n| relations = \n| base      = [[Temple of Thor]]\n| group     = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br> [[Suits]] <br> [[Guardians of Thor]] {{Icon|GOT}} (infiltrated)\n| first     = \"[[Two Powers Become One]]\"\n| last      = \n| gender    = Male\n| hair      = Bald\n| eyes      = \n| american  = [[Wayne Grayson]]\n}}\n'''Unnamed Suit 012''' is a [[Suit]] in [[the Organization]] who operates from the [[Temple of Thor]] in [[Iceland]].\n\n== History ==\nThis Suit infiltrated the [[Guardians of Thor]] on behalf of [[the Organization]]. He tried to prevent [[Dante Vale]], [[Montehue]], and the Huntik team from getting the hammer, [[Mjolnir]]. However, he failed even after multiple tries. {{source|Two Powers Become One}}\n\n==Personality==\nThis Suit was confident and unpleasant. When he thinks the odds are in his favor, his ego gets really big.\n\n== Abilities ==\nThis Suit relied on his huge army of [[Guardians of Thor]] to fight for him as well as his primary Titan, [[Jokoul]]. \n\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n{{SpellCol|max=1}}\n*[[Touchram]]\n*[[Raypulse]]\n{{SpellColEnd}}\n\n=== Bonded Titans ===\n{{TitanCollection}}\n{{TitanRow | [[Jokoul]]|  | | This icy [[Organization]] Titan is this Suit's go-to Titan for combat. }}\n{{TitanCollectionFooter}}\n\n== Gallery ==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\">\nFile:Organization operative.png\nS1E08 Suit 012 invokes Jokoul.png\nS1E08 Unnamed Suit 012.png\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]\n[[Category:Guardians of Thor]]","categories":["Characters","Guardians of Thor","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_title":"Temple of Thor","label":"Temple of Thor","target_id":"huntik:page:2910","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Temple_of_Thor","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2910"},{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"Guardians of Thor","label":"Guardians of Thor","target_id":"huntik:page:2800","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Guar